{"id":"avance","lemma":"avance","pos":"noun","rank":2994,"glosses":["advance","progress","advance payment"],"ipa":"/aˈbanθe/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"avances"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-avance.wav","examples":[{"text":"Eso fue un enorme avance.","en":"That was a huge breakthrough.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804336","words":[{"g":"that","l":"ése"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"enormous, huge"},null]},{"text":"Observaré tu avance desde mi ordenador.","en":"I'll monitor your progress from my computer.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705427","words":[{"g":"to observe, to eye","l":"observar"},{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"since"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"computer"}]},{"text":"No hay grandes avances.","en":"There are no breakthroughs.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804334","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"big, large","l":"grande"},null]},{"text":"Él está contento por el avance que ha hecho en el último tiempo.","en":"He is happy about the progress he has recently made.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"content"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"done, completed"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"final"},{"g":"time"}]},{"text":"Él está logrando grandes avances en inglés.","en":"He is making great progress in English.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to get, to obtain","l":"lograr"},{"g":"big, large","l":"grande"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"English"}]}]}